<section class="area-hero area-rockhill"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Rock Hill, South Carolina roofing</p><h1>Rock Hill Roof Repair, Replacement &amp; Storm Documentation</h1><p>Majestic serves properties across the Rock Hill region with free inspections, roofing repairs, replacements, emergency tarping and factual storm-damage documentation. Availability is confirmed by address.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc">Roof insurance documentation →</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="tel:+19808005991">@Lang.T("Call Majestic")</a></div></div></section><section class="area-services section" id="services"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Full-service roofing</p><h2>The right path for the roof problem.</h2></div><p>Majestic confirms the physical scope, written price, materials and schedule after reviewing the property.</p></div><div class="damage-grid area-service-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>@Lang.T("Roof replacement")</h3><p>Architectural, premium and impact-resistant shingle options, plus qualifying metal and commercial systems.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>@Lang.T("Repairs & leak diagnosis")</h3><p>Shingles, flashing, pipe boots, vents, chimneys, penetrations and visible decking concerns.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Storm documentation</h3><p>Free inspection, photographs, measurements, written scope, adjuster-site coordination and contractor supplements.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Emergency tarping</h3><p>Temporary water protection when weather, access and site conditions are safe.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h3>@Lang.T("Gutters, fascia & soffit")</h3><p>Roof-edge and drainage components inspected and scoped with the roofing system.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h3>Annual Roof Tune-Up</h3><p>$350 general maintenance for accessible roof areas and exposed sealing details.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="area-coverage section"><div class="site-shell scope-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Coverage by address</p><h2>Approximately 90 minutes from Charlotte or Rock Hill.</h2><p>Roof and claim-related inspections do not have a travel fee. Crew and emergency availability are confirmed for the property before dispatch. Raleigh is outside the service area.</p></div><div class="city-list"><span>Rock Hill</span><span>Fort Mill</span><span>Tega Cay</span><span>Indian Land</span><span>Lake Wylie</span><span>Clover</span><span>York</span><span>Catawba</span><span>Lancaster</span><span>Van Wyck</span><span>Chester</span><span>Richburg</span><span>Fort Lawn</span></div></div></section><section class="resource-cta section"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2>Request your free roof inspection.</h2><a class="button button-gold" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc#claim-form">Open inspection form →</a></div></section>
